 158:../../util/ringbuff_util.c **** /**
 159:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \brief           Read data from buffer.
 160:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * Copies data from buffer to `data` array and marks buffer as free for maximum `btr` number of byt
 161:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  *
 162:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \param[in]       buff: Buffer handle
 163:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \param[out]      data: Pointer to output memory to copy buffer data to
 164:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \param[in]       btr: Number of bytes to read
 165:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \return          Number of bytes read and copied to data array
 166:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  */
